  "details": "With the general thought most users have now about white and green users, i believe we should roll back the nameplate changes so that everyone is green again.\n\nKeep the safety settings but keep it within the safety menu/ inspection menu on the player themselves.\n\nThere is a lot of bias vs white and green users that is purely visual that didn't exist pre-safety settings that makes it a less welcoming community than it used to be.\n\nFor a reference point of me personally, i am an ex-veteran/current Trusted user, so its not an issue for me personally, but i do catch myself unconsciously biasing white users because typically they are users who wont play again and just play very toxic and offensively.\nI didn't have that outlook prior because there was no way for me to know the person was new until they said it themselves, it was purely created by the safety system bias.\n\nKeep the current system, but revert the name tag color system back to the original version of everyone being a solid color, and friends being a different color.",
